            "question": "The primary advantage of MMM over MTA in 2026 is:",
            "options": [
                "A) MMM is cheaper",
                "B) MMM uses aggregate data that doesn't depend on individual tracking \u2014 durable despite cookie deprecation and privacy restrictions",
                "C) MMM is more accurate",
                "D) MMM is faster"
            ],
            "correct": 1,
